<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54529" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταμην-ύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>point out, make known</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. διὰ γραμμάτων τοὺς οὔρους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.30
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόδ᾽ ἐγὼ καταμηνύσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					176
				</span></i>
			 (anap.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Them.</u>
				23
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἑωυτὸν ὡς εἴη Ἱστιαῖος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.29
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν Ὅμηρον ὅτι . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Hom.</u>
					p.54
				</span></i>
			 O.:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
			</span></i><i>adAth.</i><i><span class="en">
				273d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>inform against</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				13.49
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				24.60
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰς πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					4.43
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπό τινος -μηνυθείς</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				62
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cod.Just.</u>
				10.11.8.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of a god,
				<i>give a sign</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				3.3.2
			</span></i>.</div>
